<![CDATA[<h1>20. 函数</h1><p>Author: Chiyuki(l12345p9876x0@gmail.com)</p>
        
          <p>函数把一段可重复使用的代码封装成一个独立的功能单元：接收输入（参数）、执行逻辑、返回结果。程序里反复出现的代码都值得抽成函数——代码更短更清楚，改一处全局生效，也方便分工和测试。</p>
<p><code>print()</code>、<code>len()</code>、<code>input()</code> 这些是 Python 自带的内置函数；用 <code>def</code> 自己定义的叫自定义函数。函数必须先定义后使用。</p>
<h2 id="函数的定义与调用">
<a class="header-anchor" href="#%e5%87%bd%e6%95%b0%e7%9a%84%e5%ae%9a%e4%b9%89%e4%b8%8e%e8%b0%83%e7%94%a8"></a>
函数的定义与调用
</h2><p>用 <code>def</code> 定义函数：</p>
<div class="highlight"><pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"><code class="language-python" data-lang="python"><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="k">def</span> <span class="nf">函数名</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="n">参数列表</span><span class="p">):</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">    <span class="n">函数体</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">    <span class="k">return</span> <span class="p">[</span><span class="n">表达式</span><span class="p">]</span>
</span></span></code></pre></div><ul>
<li>以 <code>def</code> 开头，后接函数名和圆括号 <code>()</code>，行尾是冒号，函数体缩进。</li>
<li>函数名遵循标识符命名规则，一般是动词。命名风格用 ==snake_case==（全小写、下划线分词），详见 <a href="/post/04-coding-style/">04.编码规范</a>。</li>
<li>参数列表是函数需要的数据，多个参数用逗号分隔。函数可以没有参数，但圆括号不能省略。</li>
<li>函数体一般含三部分：文档说明、功能代码、<code>return [表达式]</code>。</li>
<li><code>return</code> 结束函数并把值交给调用方；不带表达式的 <code>return</code> 或没有 <code>return</code> 语句，都相当于返回 <code>None</code>。</li>
</ul>
<p>定义完不调用不会执行，调用一次执行一次。</p>
<div class="highlight"><pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"><code class="language-python" data-lang="python"><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="k">def</span> <span class="nf">print_hello</span><span class="p">():</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">    <span class="s2">&#34;&#34;&#34;
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="s2">    打印hello world
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="s2">    &#34;&#34;&#34;</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">    <span class="nb">print</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="s2">&#34;hello world&#34;</span><span class="p">)</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="c1"># 先定义，再调用</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="n">print_hello</span><span class="p">()</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="nb">print</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="s2">&#34;--------&#34;</span><span class="p">)</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="n">print_hello</span><span class="p">()</span>
</span></span></code></pre></div><div class="highlight"><pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"><code class="language-text" data-lang="text"><span class="line"><span class="cl">hello world
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">--------
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">hello world
</span></span></code></pre></div><p>带参数和带返回值的写法：</p>
<div class="highlight"><pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"><code class="language-python" data-lang="python"><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="k">def</span> <span class="nf">print_star</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="n">line</span><span class="p">,</span> <span class="n">column</span><span class="p">):</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">    <span class="s2">&#34;&#34;&#34;
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="s2">    打印指定行数和列数的星号
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="s2">    &#34;&#34;&#34;</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">    <span class="k">for</span> <span class="n">i</span> <span class="ow">in</span> <span class="nb">range</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="n">line</span><span class="p">):</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">        <span class="k">for</span> <span class="n">j</span> <span class="ow">in</span> <span class="nb">range</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="n">column</span><span class="p">):</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">            <span class="nb">print</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="s2">&#34;*&#34;</span><span class="p">,</span> <span class="n">end</span><span class="o">=</span><span class="s2">&#34; &#34;</span><span class="p">)</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">        <span class="nb">print</span><span class="p">()</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="k">def</span> <span class="nf">add</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="n">a</span><span class="p">,</span> <span class="n">b</span><span class="p">):</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">    <span class="s2">&#34;&#34;&#34;
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="s2">    返回两个数的和
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="s2">    &#34;&#34;&#34;</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">    <span class="k">return</span> <span class="n">a</span> <span class="o">+</span> <span class="n">b</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="n">print_star</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="mi">5</span><span class="p">,</span> <span class="mi">10</span><span class="p">)</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="nb">print</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="s2">&#34;add(1, 2) = &#34;</span><span class="p">,</span> <span class="n">add</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="mi">1</span><span class="p">,</span> <span class="mi">2</span><span class="p">))</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="nb">print</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="s2">&#34;add(2, 3) = &#34;</span><span class="p">,</span> <span class="n">add</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="mi">2</span><span class="p">,</span> <span class="mi">3</span><span class="p">))</span>
</span></span></code></pre></div><div class="highlight"><pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"><code class="language-text" data-lang="text"><span class="line"><span class="cl">* * * * * * * * * *
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">* * * * * * * * * *
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">* * * * * * * * * *
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">* * * * * * * * * *
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">* * * * * * * * * *
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">add(1, 2) =  3
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">add(2, 3) =  5
</span></span></code></pre></div><p>函数带来的好处：程序更简短清晰；提高开发效率和代码重用性；便于分工协作、集中管理和后期维护。</p>
        
